04:28.700 --> 04:30.600
The hunters have come back.

04:30.940 --> 04:32.040
Eh? Already?

04:32.040 --> 04:32.940
That was quick.

04:35.840 --> 04:36.670
What's wrong?

04:37.640 --> 04:38.670
Where's Mom?

04:40.650 --> 04:42.140
About that...

04:50.460 --> 04:51.480
Haré!

04:53.560 --> 04:55.320
M-Mom is missing!?

04:55.930 --> 04:56.920
Sorry, Haré.

04:57.500 --> 04:59.990
But, our lives were in danger also.

05:00.070 --> 05:02.300
But, why? What happened?

05:02.730 --> 05:04.630
We were assaulted by a strange creature.

05:04.900 --> 05:08.400
I ordered a retreat,
but in the commotion, Weda...

05:08.770 --> 05:10.300
She got separated from the group.

05:10.440 --> 05:13.710
When we realized it, we all searched but
couldn't find her.

05:13.810 --> 05:14.300
Eh?

05:14.380 --> 05:17.640
Don't worry. When the sun comes up,
we'll go looking for her again.

05:18.920 --> 05:21.350
