05:28.990 --> 05:30.550
Weda is alive.

05:32.000 --> 05:34.520
Always, within my heart. Right?

05:34.630 --> 05:36.070
Right? What do you mean, right?

05:36.070 --> 05:37.660
That's jumping to
a conclusion way too far ahead!

05:38.370 --> 05:40.010
Don't throw your hope away!

05:40.010 --> 05:41.110
I'm not!

05:41.110 --> 05:43.130
They haven't even started looking for her yet!

05:43.610 --> 05:44.800
Oh, is that so?

05:44.880 --> 05:45.670
That's right!

05:47.650 --> 05:49.180
My Weda!

05:49.180 --> 05:49.700
Your?

05:50.080 --> 05:53.620
I was at her side, and I couldn't protect my
dear Weda!

05:53.620 --> 05:55.180
I'm such a despicable guy!

05:55.250 --> 05:55.650
Uighur?

