like Ravenna.

06:01.590 --> 06:05.090
I don't have a Kansai accent like Toposte,
and I'm not a cute character like Marie.

06:05.160 --> 06:06.870
I'm not strange like Wadi...

06:06.870 --> 06:10.170
I'm just a flat character who doesn't make
any impression.

06:10.170 --> 06:11.070
Y-You know...
I'm just a flat character who doesn't make
any impression.

06:11.570 --> 06:15.440
