06:18.540 --> 06:21.410
You know, I think you have your own
character...

06:21.680 --> 06:25.380
Or rather, this is the first I've heard of Uighur
being in love with Weda!

06:26.180 --> 06:28.550
There's way too much here to comment on.
I'm at a loss.

06:29.150 --> 06:30.750
Just as I thought!

06:30.820 --> 06:32.560
I don't even have the ability to crack a joke!

06:32.560 --> 06:34.090
That's not what I mean.
I don't even have the ability to crack a joke!

06:34.090 --> 06:37.120
Nobody thinks you're boring, Uighur.

06:37.530 --> 06:39.520
Actually, you're pretty funny.

06:39.600 --> 06:41.120
That was something we found out just now.

06:42.230 --> 06:43.000
Guys...

06:44.170 --> 06:45.360
Thank you.

06:45.740 --> 06:47.530
You know, there's no need to thank us.

06:48.070 --> 06:49.940
If you're going to blame someone,
blame the doctor.

06:50.210 --> 06:51.300
