07:01.190 --> 07:02.020
Right, Haré?

07:02.090 --> 07:02.920
Wait, you mean me!?

07:04.290 --> 07:05.780
I will defeat our school doctor!

07:05.890 --> 07:07.090
Eh? Me?

07:07.090 --> 07:09.890
I challenge you,
for the happiness of me and my Weda!

07:10.660 --> 07:11.320
Why?

07:11.700 --> 07:12.060
Don't act dumb, doctor.
I'm going to be the one that protects Weda!

07:12.060 --> 07:13.370
This is an unexpected turn of events.
Don't act dumb, doctor.
I'm going to be the one that protects Weda!

07:13.370 --> 07:13.730
Don't act dumb, doctor.
