What's that supposed to mean?

07:23.540 --> 07:23.640
What's that supposed to mean?
All right, well said!

07:23.640 --> 07:24.910
Yeah! Leave us alone!
All right, well said!

07:24.910 --> 07:25.140
Someone, at least stop one of them.

07:25.140 --> 07:27.110
Then, we should duke it out fair and square!
Someone, at least stop one of them.

07:27.110 --> 07:27.450
Then, we should duke it out fair and square!

07:27.450 --> 07:28.150
Then, we should duke it out fair and square!
Oh, it's all your fault!

07:28.150 --> 07:29.550
Have you been listening
at all to what I'm saying?
Oh, it's all your fault!

07:29.550 --> 07:30.820
Have you been listening
at all to what I'm saying?
Guu, calm Uighur down!

07:30.820 --> 07:31.980
No! There's no need for me to listen.
Guu, calm Uighur down!

07:31.980 --> 07:32.640
No! There's no need for me to listen.

07:32.750 --> 07:33.410
Listen!

07:33.490 --> 07:34.520
Don't talk back!

07:34.520 --> 07:36.890
Who do you think is responsible? Who!?

07:37.220 --> 07:38.160
Doctor!

07:38.160 --> 07:39.650
You are the one person I will never forgive!

07:40.760 --> 07:41.230
Huh?

07:42.490 --> 07:43.320
I calmed him down.

07:44.130 --> 07:45.100
...Oh, well.

07:45.800 --> 07:48.860
Hey, elder,
what kind of a strange creature was it?

07:48.970 --> 07:50.300
Let's see...

07:50.640 --> 07:52.600
It was like nothing we've ever seen.

07:52.600 --> 07:56.200
To put it in words, it was like darkness, like
despair - it was absolute blackness.

07:56.510 --> 07:58.370
That was why I was caught off guard.

07:58.740 --> 08:01.410
It was huge. Was it double my size?

08:01.650 --> 08:05.410
It was unbelievably hard.
The spear didn't go through its skin at all.

08:05.720 --> 08:08.520
It was shining.
Could those have been its eyes?

08:08.920 --> 08:12.250
It stank.
It was a smell I've never smelled before.

08:12.720 --> 08:14.590
It was making a strange noise.

08:14.830 --> 08:17.020
Wait a minute. What was it?

08:17.200 --> 08:18.660
I don't have any idea.

08:18.760 --> 08:19.730
In other words...

08:20.530 --> 08:21.330
It's black...

08:21.330 --> 08:22.070
...and big...

08:22.070 --> 08:22.770
...and hard...

08:22.770 --> 08:23.470
...and shiny...

08:23.470 --> 08:24.200
...and smelly...

08:24.200 --> 08:26.260
...and makes a strange noise.

08:26.500 --> 08:31.130
A creature that is black, big, hard, shiny,
smelly, and makes a strange noise...

08:31.310 --> 08:35.770
I have no idea what it could be,
but just hearing that much gives me a really
bad feeling.

08:37.480 --> 08:38.220
Okay!

08:38.220 --> 08:43.490
The big, black, hard, shiny, smelly, and
strange noise-making creature
that I came up with is...

08:43.490 --> 08:44.610
...this!

08:45.190 --> 08:47.490
Exactly what part of that is a dangerous
creature?

08:47.490 --> 08:48.420
I mean...

08:48.830 --> 08:51.460
...unlike what you see, it's really tough.

08:51.560 --> 08:52.290
No, no.

08:52.400 --> 08:57.200
The real big, black, hard, shiny, smelly, and
strange noise-making creature is...

08:57.200 --> 08:58.070
...like this!

08:59.070 --> 09:00.940
Eh? You think so?

09:01.040 --> 09:02.510
I'm sure that it is!

09:02.570 --> 09:05.100
No matter how you think about it,
this one looks stronger

09:05.410 --> 09:07.310
This guy is cute!

09:07.310 --> 09:09.080
Both of you are so unrealistic...

09:09.080 --> 09:10.740
Let's think more realistically.

09:10.880 --> 09:14.820
The creature that is black, big, hard, shiny,
smelly, and makes a strange noise is...

09:14.820 --> 09:15.380
...this!

09:16.860 --> 09:18.020
What is that?

09:18.120 --> 09:19.320
That's a human.

09:19.420 --> 09:21.130
What part of that is real?

09:21.130 --> 09:22.390
Yeah! Tell us!

09:22.630 --> 09:23.790
Well, see...

09:25.530 --> 09:26.960
All of you are so young.

09:27.300 --> 09:31.930
The creature that is black, big, hard, shiny,
smelly, and makes a strange noise...

09:32.000 --> 09:34.770
In reality must be like this!

09:39.480 --> 09:42.110
We won't accomplish anything by just sitting
here debating.

09:42.250 --> 09:42.980
That's right.

09:43.050 --> 09:44.410
It's just getting us confused.

09:45.050 --> 09:46.120
You know, after all...

09:46.120 --> 09:50.920
the black, big, hard, shiny, smelly, and
strange noise-making creature has to be...

09:51.060 --> 09:51.950
...this.

09:54.360 --> 09:56.090
What in the world are you drawing!?

09:56.430 --> 09:59.230
Doctor! Mom is gone! Aren't you worried!?

09:59.230 --> 10:00.700
It's someone else's problem after all, isn't it!?

10:00.800 --> 10:03.320
Idiot! You're missing one important point.

10:03.400 --> 10:03.920
Huh?

10:04.570 --> 10:07.440
Can you find Weda by
just making a big deal over this?

10:09.340 --> 10:10.500
That's enough. Just stop it.

10:10.580 --> 10:11.170
Guu...

10:12.110 --> 10:14.410
What am I doing, getting all agitated by
myself?

10:14.780 --> 10:17.410
Pushing all my fears onto other people,
taking out my aggression on others...

10:17.780 --> 10:19.510
So, I'll draw it.

10:19.680 --> 10:20.280
Huh?

10:20.450 --> 10:22.220
How big is that creature?

10:22.290 --> 10:24.220
They've been saying that it's big.

10:24.290 --> 10:25.590
Big...

10:26.360 --> 10:28.160
...any other characteristics?

10:28.690 --> 10:32.420
It's hard, and shiny, and smelly,
and makes a strange noise...

10:32.600 --> 10:35.290
But what of it!?
Don't make me say it so many times.

10:35.370 --> 10:40.170
Big, hard, shiny, and smelly.

10:41.810 --> 10:42.530
Oh no...

10:42.670 --> 10:45.400
And it's all black,
and makes a strange noise...

10:46.080 --> 10:46.840
There.

11:00.960 --> 11:03.450
How did so much time fly by?

11:04.330 --> 11:06.990
If something happened to Mom during this
time I was...

11:08.400 --> 11:09.160
All right!

11:10.470 --> 11:11.870
Haré! Where are you going!?

11:30.160 --> 11:32.950
I've come in pretty deep, so where's Mom?

11:46.170 --> 11:47.260
Mom...

11:51.540 --> 11:53.840
W-W-W-What are you doing here?

11:54.080 --> 11:55.050
I followed you.

11:55.110 --> 11:58.010
Ugh. But I ran all the way here? How did you
get here so quickly?

11:58.620 --> 12:01.050
Let's set those details aside.

12:01.120 --> 12:03.050
Don't set them aside. Bring them here.

12:03.120 --> 12:04.420
Then we bring it here.

12:04.420 --> 12:07.980
What I brought here,
I shrunk and threw in the river.

12:08.060 --> 12:09.530
Don't throw it in there. Pick it up.

12:09.590 --> 12:12.190
What I picked up, I lit on fire.

12:12.300 --> 12:13.230
Snuff it out!

12:13.360 --> 12:18.300
On top of snuffing the fire out, I kneaded it
and turned it into a ball, and ate it.

12:18.640 --> 12:20.330
Wah! What are you doing?

12:21.870 --> 12:24.570
Geez, what are we really doing?

12:25.340 --> 12:27.050
Helpful Guu!

12:27.050 --> 12:28.270
I'm not being helped.

12:30.980 --> 12:32.920
You really want to find her no matter what?

12:32.980 --> 12:33.510
Huh?

12:34.790 --> 12:37.410
Do you really want to find Weda that much?

12:37.660 --> 12:39.090
Of course I do!

12:39.090 --> 12:39.750
Why?

12:39.920 --> 12:42.390
Why? Do I need a reason!?

12:44.500 --> 12:45.390
I mean...

12:46.530 --> 12:48.690
This is my one and only mom...

12:49.430 --> 12:50.630
I have to find her.

12:50.940 --> 12:53.560
Hey, Haré, you always say...

12:53.870 --> 12:57.980
...that if your mom wasn't around you'd be
able to play games, read manga...

12:57.980 --> 13:01.250
...eat snacks, and drink juice as much as you
want... you're in heaven.

13:01.250 --> 13:02.250
Hurray!

13:02.250 --> 13:04.010
Ugh! Don't dance around so strangely!

13:04.350 --> 13:08.120
Besides, you're always complaining about
having to do her chores for her.

13:08.220 --> 13:09.650
That may be true!

13:09.990 --> 13:15.320
But, I'm sure that Mom faced plenty of hard
times when I was little.

13:16.060 --> 13:22.470
If Mom is gone,
I don't know for who I would make meals and
do the laundry and clean for.

13:24.000 --> 13:25.400
Ah, I understand.

13:25.570 --> 13:28.160
Eh? Guu, could it be
that you're going to look for Mom?

13:28.240 --> 13:30.140
By any chance,
do you know where she is, Guu?

13:30.780 --> 13:31.810
No. Just asking.

13:31.810 --> 13:33.340
What's that supposed to mean!?

13:33.340 --> 13:34.180
Hurray!

13:34.180 --> 13:35.540
Don't avoid it!
Hurray!

13:46.690 --> 13:49.020
But, I think I'm glad that Guu came.

13:49.130 --> 13:50.750
It's reassuring.

13:51.900 --> 13:56.600
To be honest, this is the first time that I've
come this far into the jungle.

13:57.940 --> 13:58.700
Guu?

13:59.470 --> 14:00.030
Shoes.

14:03.210 --> 14:05.180
Why are there shoes here, of all places?

14:05.440 --> 14:06.910
Could someone be committing suicide?

14:07.410 --> 14:10.180
I'm reporting live from the jungle.

14:10.180 --> 14:12.020
It's been an hour since we entered the jungle.

14:12.020 --> 14:13.380
There's nothing left that can be called a road
and what lies ahead of us could be called
totally unexplored territory.

14:13.380 --> 14:14.390
Hey, Guu...
There's nothing left that can be called a road
