What are you playing?

14:19.290 --> 14:20.850
Oh, what is that over there?

14:23.190 --> 14:25.530
It's labeled, "The Genkai Sea of Tears."

14:25.600 --> 14:27.500
Who does this tape belong to?

14:27.570 --> 14:30.470
What was the person feeling as she listened
to this song?

14:30.540 --> 14:32.370
And, what is she doing at this very moment?

14:32.370 --> 14:33.770
Hey, let's stop this...

14:33.770 --> 14:34.070
Oh!

14:34.140 --> 14:34.630
What?

14:34.910 --> 14:37.200
T-This is... I definitely feel a human behind
this.

14:37.310 --> 14:41.800
Was the remorse she felt towards society
what kept her standing here?

14:42.150 --> 14:43.740
And here, we are going to witness...

14:44.150 --> 14:47.350
...something even more startling!

14:48.250 --> 14:51.150
Why do you know about the future as well?

14:51.260 --> 14:52.550
Because the program is rigged.

14:52.790 --> 14:53.950
That can't be true!

14:54.060 --> 14:55.250
We're airing live.

14:55.330 --> 14:56.760
That's not what I mean.

14:59.500 --> 15:00.330
W-What?

15:02.300 --> 15:03.200
A warning?

15:04.440 --> 15:05.990
Geez, what is it?

15:11.610 --> 15:13.010
We finally found you.

15:13.080 --> 15:14.240
I'm glad you're safe.

15:14.580 --> 15:17.610
Everyone else formed a search party and
headed out.

15:18.050 --> 15:19.240
Search party?

15:19.320 --> 15:21.310
So Haré, you should go home at once.

15:21.620 --> 15:22.980
But, Mom hasn't...

15:23.150 --> 15:26.490
It's hard to conduct the search without
stirring up the jungle animals.

15:26.560 --> 15:27.290
That's right.

15:27.290 --> 15:31.750
On top of that, we're facing a creature that's
black, big, hard, shiny, smelly, and makes a
strange noise.

15:32.200 --> 15:33.750
But, I...

15:34.100 --> 15:36.400
And Addy, I want you to go home too.

15:36.570 --> 15:37.660
Eh? Why?

15:38.170 --> 15:40.190
You don't love me anymore...

15:40.270 --> 15:41.140
I see...

15:41.210 --> 15:41.860
That's not it!

15:42.140 --> 15:44.510
Then, why are you telling me to go home!?

15:44.710 --> 15:45.510
That's because...

15:45.580 --> 15:47.810
It's because
you don't love me anymore, after all!

15:49.150 --> 15:50.580
Um, Hello?

15:50.580 --> 15:52.240
That's not it, Addy! Listen to me!

15:52.520 --> 15:54.750
I'm worried about your well-being!

15:55.190 --> 15:56.680
I want you to stay safe and sound.

15:57.390 --> 15:59.250
I want you to live happily.

15:59.960 --> 16:00.720
Chet...

16:01.530 --> 16:02.220
Addy...

16:04.800 --> 16:06.060
I'm sorry, Chet.

16:06.130 --> 16:07.760
I was so foolish...

16:07.830 --> 16:10.700
But, if I were to lose you,
I'd rather die instead.

16:10.940 --> 16:11.990
The same goes for me!

16:12.200 --> 16:14.170
I'll absolutely,
positively make sure I come back alive.

16:14.510 --> 16:15.440
Really?

16:15.540 --> 16:16.730
I promise.

16:22.280 --> 16:23.250
Oh, Chet...

16:23.250 --> 16:24.270
What is it?

16:27.050 --> 16:29.120
If you want me, you have to catch me!

16:29.120 --> 16:31.350
Oh! You said it! Wait up!

16:31.960 --> 16:32.360
Someone's parent is missing, and what's
with this lovey-dovey-ness?

16:32.360 --> 16:33.760
I caught you!
Someone's parent is missing, and what's
with this lovey-dovey-ness?

16:33.760 --> 16:36.190
Someone's parent is missing, and what's
with this lovey-dovey-ness?

16:36.490 --> 16:38.230
Geez, Chet, you're so perverted!

16:38.230 --> 16:39.630
What was that, you?

16:39.630 --> 16:41.290
So annoying!

16:41.430 --> 16:45.270
Someone is barely breathing next to you,
and you go off with your "mm's" and "ooh's"
and "aah's" and "no's" and "silly's"!

16:45.270 --> 16:46.170
Shut up!

16:46.170 --> 16:48.930
What do you think
the brink of death is, you two!?

16:49.040 --> 16:49.940
I'm sorry...

16:50.310 --> 16:54.400
There are things you're allowed to do, and
things you're not allowed to do in front of
someone injured half to death!

16:54.510 --> 16:55.710
Actually, you seem pretty healthy.

16:55.850 --> 17:01.480
Your existence itself is indecent exposure,
so if you're going to make out, do it in your
own home...

17:02.350 --> 17:04.450
Mom! Hang on!

17:04.990 --> 17:06.390
I...

17:06.390 --> 17:08.290
What? Mom? What do you want to say?

17:08.760 --> 17:11.700
Stop with the love-comedy.

17:13.500 --> 17:15.490
Stop with the love-comedy?

17:15.770 --> 17:18.600
And those were her last words.

17:18.670 --> 17:20.430
It's no joking matter, so cut it out!

17:20.810 --> 17:23.140
Addy! Chet! Call for everyone else! Hurry!

17:23.610 --> 17:24.300
Roger!

17:26.440 --> 17:28.080
Mom...

17:28.080 --> 17:29.600
You're so badly injured.

17:31.520 --> 17:33.420
Guu! Grab Mom's leg.

17:33.420 --> 17:34.680
Let's carry her a little way towards the
village!

17:37.290 --> 17:38.760
Guu! Help me out!

17:38.860 --> 17:39.520
There.

17:44.760 --> 17:45.820
What is that?

17:45.960 --> 17:50.730
The creature that's black, big, hard, shiny,
smelly, and makes a strange noise.

17:50.840 --> 17:51.820
In other words...

17:51.900 --> 17:52.490
A bear.

17:52.600 --> 17:53.970
A bear? That thing!?

17:54.110 --> 17:56.100
A carnivorous mammal of the bear family.

17:56.170 --> 18:00.340
It has muscular limbs, a large head, large
ears and small eyes.

18:00.410 --> 18:03.710
Its claws are very strong, and it's extremely
dangerous when hungry.

18:22.800 --> 18:25.000
That thing! That's what attacked Mom.

18:25.470 --> 18:28.300
Damn you!!

18:28.740 --> 18:30.760
Get Mom to the village, no matter what!

18:30.840 --> 18:31.770
I trust you!

18:32.080 --> 18:33.940
I'll buy you some time.

18:53.260 --> 18:53.920
So weak.

18:54.400 --> 18:56.630
You're in no position to talk.

19:03.070 --> 19:04.410
She needs to hurry up and escape.

19:04.740 --> 19:06.770
Oh, I'm in so much pain that I can't speak.

19:11.920 --> 19:13.010
Run, Guu!

19:26.260 --> 19:29.600
I don't really know what happened after that.

19:30.640 --> 19:31.730
All I remember is...

19:32.370 --> 19:33.800
Iron Claw...

19:35.670 --> 19:37.770
Neck Hanging Tree...

19:39.380 --> 19:40.840
Camel Clutch...

19:42.280 --> 19:44.510
Argentine Backbreaker...

19:45.950 --> 19:47.420
And the final blow against the bear...

19:48.020 --> 19:49.450
A Bear Hug.

19:50.420 --> 19:51.850
All outdated moves.

19:55.630 --> 19:59.930
All I remember is that someone
defeated the bear...

20:01.270 --> 20:01.990
Who was it?

20:09.210 --> 20:11.270
Oh, you've come to.

20:11.880 --> 20:12.870
Mom!

20:13.080 --> 20:15.740
Oh, don't raise your voice.
It echoes in my wounds.

20:15.950 --> 20:17.310
S-Sorry...

20:17.620 --> 20:19.880
But, I'm so glad that you were all right.

20:20.790 --> 20:24.520
Chet and Addy found us, and everyone
carried us back home.

20:24.990 --> 20:26.080
Oh, I see...

20:27.190 --> 20:30.890
But still, that woman who defeated the bear...

20:31.130 --> 20:32.620
I wonder who that was?

20:33.730 --> 20:35.100
Hey, where's Guu?

20:36.570 --> 20:37.360
You called?

20:39.070 --> 20:40.910
W-What is that?

20:40.910 --> 20:41.740
Fur coat.

20:42.240 --> 20:44.430
H-H-H-How did you get it?

20:45.180 --> 20:45.900
I found it.

20:46.240 --> 20:49.300
It's wonderful.
That's what you call a good find.

20:49.580 --> 20:50.880
You found it?

20:52.280 --> 20:53.880
Dinner's ready!

20:54.290 --> 20:55.150
Okay!

20:55.220 --> 20:56.080
Dinner?

20:56.150 --> 20:59.680
Rebecca made our dinner today,
since I'm like this.

20:59.960 --> 21:01.420
Thanks for the food!

21:03.830 --> 21:05.390
Haré, you're not going to eat?

21:05.730 --> 21:07.220
What's in this pot?

21:07.770 --> 21:08.730
Meat.

21:09.500 --> 21:10.740
I don't know what it is...

21:10.740 --> 21:14.600
...but there was so much meat that I shared it
with everyone in the village.

21:14.670 --> 21:16.230
I'm asking, what's the meat from?

21:16.310 --> 21:17.600
It's just meat.

21:18.240 --> 21:18.640
Tasty!

21:18.640 --> 21:19.640
Tasty!
That night, every household had a feast.

21:21.640 --> 21:22.360
That night, every household had a feast.

22:33.500 --> 22:33.600
NEXT EPISODE

22:34.600 --> 22:35.500
Hello, Marie.
Oh, you've changed your hairdo

22:35.500 --> 22:36.360
Yea its really cute.

22:36.360 --> 22:37.430
Hey, it's Gupta. Morning

22:37.430 --> 22:39.270
But What's with that Hairdo?
Why don't you get it cut?

22:39.270 --> 22:40.570
Eh? The old hairdresser is scary?

22:40.570 --> 22:42.500
That's not like you!

22:42.500 --> 22:42.800
Oh, all right,
someone tag along with him. Wait...

22:42.800 --> 22:44.270
Oh, all right,
someone tag along with him, Wait,,,,

22:44.270 --> 22:45.910
There she is! The oid barber woman!

22:45.910 --> 22:47.040
Where did she come from!?

22:47.040 --> 22:48.910
Wah! She's totally talking to ghosts!

22:48.910 --> 22:50.170
Gupta's not one for scary things.

22:51.710 --> 22:53.880
Granny, you said
you were caiied here. By who?

22:53.880 --> 22:55.120
Eh? The soui of your oid man?

22:55.120 --> 22:55.990
Scary!

22:56.350 --> 22:58.000
Next episode of Haré+Guu: Love, Love Grandpa

22:57.990 --> 22:59.900
Next episode of Haré+Guu: Love, Love Grandpa

22:59.890 --> 23:02.920
Love, Love Grandpa
